# "Neon Lights" — EDM / Progressive House
# BeatForge Studio

bpm 128
swing 0
steps 32
kit 808
kit synth

# Master
reverb 0.20
delay 0.25
enhancer 0.40
width 1.30

# Drums — 4-on-floor energy
kick     "x...x...x...x...x...x...x...x..."
snare    "........x...............x......."
hh       "..x...x...x...x...x...x...x...x."
clap     "....x.......x.......x.......x..."

# Drum mix
vol kick 0.85
vol snare 0.70
vol hh 0.35
vol clap 0.60
pan hh 0.20
lpf hh 8000
sidechain kick hh
sidechain kick clap
sendverb clap 0.30
senddly snare 0.20

# Chord progression
scale D minor
chord "Dm Am Bb C"

# Melody
note "D4 ~ F4 ~ A4 ~ F4 D4 ~ ~ C4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ D4 ~ F4 ~ A4 D5 A4 F4 D4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"
